    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nCharming Original Cottage with Beautiful Mature Gardens - A Home Full of Character\n\nThis original cottage dates back to the early part of the last century and has been lovingly maintained and tastefully restored over the years.\n\nThe original two-up, two-down cottage has been thoughtfully extended and now provides comfortable accommodation comprising a kitchen, sitting room, shower room, bedroom and bright sunroom at ground floor level, with two further bedrooms on the first floor. The house is presented in very good condition and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe property is heated by a solid fuel stove and benefits from a number of upgrades, including the addition of the sunroom. Services include mains water, standard septic tank sewerage system, ESB, electricity and broadband availability.\n\nOutside, the property is surrounded by beautifully landscaped, mature gardens that will be a particular delight for gardening enthusiasts. Bursting with established trees, plants, shrubs and seasonal flowers, the gardens provide a peaceful and private setting.\nThe extensive planting also creates a wonderful haven for wildlife, making this a truly special outdoor space to enjoy throughout the year.\n\nThe property is situated approximately 1km from the Village amenities in Killinick. Rosslare Strand and Rosslare Harbour are within easy driving distance, while Wexford Town Centre is also readily accessible.\n\nThis delightful cottage offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a character filled home in a convenient and attractive location, whether as a permanent residence, holiday home or investment property.\n\nPLEASE NOTE THAT THE PROPERTY IS IN THE PATH OF THE M11 MOTORWAY DEVELOPMENT & LIABLE FOR CPO PROCESS UNDER THE PROPOSED DEVELOPMENT. \n\nViewing is strictly by appointment.\n\nVirtual tour available on request."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.19m x 1.77m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.75m x 3.16m\nFeature stove with original fireplace surround. Stairs to first floor. Concrete floor with carpet.\n\nBedroom 1. (Ground Floor) - 3.75m x 2.47m\n\n\nSunroom - 4.38m x 3.71m\nSunroom extension with views to garden.\n\nKitchen - 4.47m x 3.71m\nFitted kitchen plumbed for services. Door to rear hall and bathroom area.\n\nRear Entrance Hall - 2.43m x 1.19m\nOpen hall with door to bathroom and door to gardens.\n\nBathroom - 2.98m x 2.22m\nWith w.c. bath and w.h.b.\n\nPrimary Bedroom - 3.58m x 3.75m\nSpacious primary bedroom complemented with a w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.53m x 3.75m\nCozy third bedroom full of character.\n\nOutside - \nTraditional outbuilding and storage space.\n\n"
      },
